### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. Recherche dynamique (UserSearchCriteria, ReservationSearchCriteria, …)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Recherche : users dont prénom commence par "You"
POST {{base}}/api/users/search
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "criteria": [
    {"field": "firstName", "op": "ILIKE", "value": "You%"}
  ],
  "size": 5
}

### Recherche combinée : prénom ILIKE + tri créé desc
POST {{base}}/api/users/search
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "criteria": [
    {"field": "firstName", "op": "ILIKE", "value": "You%"}
  ],
  "sort": "createdAt,desc",
  "page": 0,
  "size": 10
}

### Recherche IN sur city
POST {{base}}/api/users/search
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "criteria": [
    {"field": "city", "op": "IN", "value": ["Casablanca", "Marrakech", "Rabat"]}
  ],
  "size": 5
}

### Recherche IS_NOT_NULL sur phone
POST {{base}}/api/users/search
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "criteria": [
    {"field": "phone", "op": "IS_NOT_NULL", "value": null}
  ],
  "size": 5
}

### Field non whitelisté → 400 + ProblemDetails RFC 7807
POST {{base}}/api/users/search
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "criteria": [
    {"field": "internalSecret", "op": "EQ", "value": "x"}
  ]
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 6. Validation Bean + Exception handler RFC 7807
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### User par UUID inexistant → 404 + ProblemDetails not-found
GET {{base}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}

### UUID malformé → 400 + ProblemDetails type-mismatch
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/not-a-valid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}

### PATCH valide → 200 + entité modifiée + log [AUDIT] côté Spring
PATCH {{base}}/api/users/{{adminUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Tanger",
  "language": "fr"
}

### PATCH avec phone format invalid → 400 + fieldErrors
PATCH {{base}}/api/users/{{adminUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "INVALID-PHONE!!"
}

### Route inexistante → 404 + ProblemDetails route-not-found
GET {{base}}/api/foo-bar-baz
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtAdmin}}

